@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/appareils

### health
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### list
GET {{baseUrl}}

### create (201)
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Washing machine", "status": "Off" }

###
@id = {{create.response.body._id}}

### get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}

### update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Washing machine", "status": "On" }

### invalid body (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "status": "Broken" }

### unknown id (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/64b7f0c2a1b2c3d4e5f60718

### malformed id (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc

### switch all (exercise)
